SECTION | KEY | VALUE
------------------------------
# toolbar.pdl - the fixed header menus of this window as data (shared reader: &.widgits/_shared-lib/petslike_toolbar.c, template: the repeat blocks at the tab bar and in the rail).
# TAB  | id | label                      a toolbar tab (the template adds the arrow); its dropdown holds the ITEM rows with the same id
# ITEM | tab id | label | verb and args   a dropdown row; the verb goes to this app's op (newpal, newroom, goto <room> ...). No verb = just closes the menu.
# The pets (tb-book) and the rooms (tb-page) rows themselves come from the op's own data (party / rooms.pdl); these rows are added after them.
TAB  | tb-pals | Pals
ITEM | tb-pals | + new pal | newpal
ITEM | tb-pals | - remove last pal | delpal
ITEM | tb-pals | - cancel - |
ITEM | tb-page | + new room | newroom
ITEM | tb-page | - cancel - |
